#: ../../../reference/interfaces/upower-observe-interface.md:0
#: ../../../reference/interfaces/upower-observe-interface.md:8
msgid "upower-observe interface"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/upower-observe-interface.md:10
msgid ""
"`upower-observe` allows operating as, or reading, from the UPower service. "
"This provides the history and statistics of power devices, such as their "
"battery levels and power usage."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/upower-observe-interface.md:12
msgid "**Auto-connect**: yes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../reference/interfaces/upower-observe-interface.md:15
msgid ""
"The `upower-observe` slot is {ref}`unsupported for parallel instances "
"<interfaces-parallel-installs-unsupported>`. The slot owns a unique system-"
"wide resource that instances would conflict over."
msgstr ""
